  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with pca_n2000 RNA and resnet50 image encoders (config_019) achieve the highest accuracy (0.639). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt and the image encoder with imagenet_vit_l while keeping aggregation (avgpool) and fusion (weighted) the same. This isolates the impact of RNA/image encoder choices, which are critical factors. It directly compares against the current best configuration with minimal changes, providing clarity on whether these encoder swaps could improve performance."
